# The multi-stage Dockerfile builds every plugin from source, so the full
# plugins/ tree is the build context. Exclude only what the build regenerates
# or never needs — keeps the context small and the build hermetic.
.git
secrets
docs

# Regenerated inside the build (do NOT ship host copies into the context)
**/node_modules
**/dist
plugins/sibyl/public/plugins
plugins/results-viewer/shinylive-export
plugins/results-viewer/r-packages
plugins/results-viewer/test-data

# Misc build/test cruft
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
